    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Global Conquest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission is clear\u2014<strong>take over and unite all 195 countries</strong> before the enemy arrives. Expand your reach, <strong>capture key territories</strong>, and use <strong>war or diplomacy</strong> to dominate the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/acc8c395882468ad37c98e4dc3863c3f.poster.avif?t=1751527902\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/acc8c395882468ad37c98e4dc3863c3f.webm?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/acc8c395882468ad37c98e4dc3863c3f.mp4?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Income Per Second \u2013 Build &amp; Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money fuels power. <strong>Your income grows every second</strong>\u2014upgrade <strong>factories, businesses, and trade routes</strong> to <strong>increase your wealth and expand your reach</strong>. The <strong>more countries you control, the more resources you command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/a3624a6ec4162a29a58ffe6400c9ae73.poster.avif?t=1751527902\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/a3624a6ec4162a29a58ffe6400c9ae73.webm?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/a3624a6ec4162a29a58ffe6400c9ae73.mp4?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f War or Influence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your path:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer with military force</strong>\u2014train troops, deploy tanks and drones, build defenses, and launch strategic invasions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/6658e98e7a3515c23766e23808172c4e.poster.avif?t=1751527902\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/6658e98e7a3515c23766e23808172c4e.webm?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/6658e98e7a3515c23766e23808172c4e.mp4?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control with influence</strong>\u2014spread culture, religion, and economic power to <strong>silently take over nations</strong> without a single shot fired.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/2301cbec0632b4b990f64b86bf61bea7.poster.avif?t=1751527902\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/2301cbec0632b4b990f64b86bf61bea7.webm?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/2301cbec0632b4b990f64b86bf61bea7.mp4?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Ultimate Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>NWO: Anarchy Collapsed</i>, <strong>there is no second place</strong>. <strong>Unite the world, command its resources, and decide the fate of civilization.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 A Strategy Game Like No Other!</strong><br>A perfect blend of <strong>deep geopolitical strategy and income-based mechanics</strong>, where <strong>expansion and efficiency lead to world domination</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New World Order: Anarchy Collapsed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is divided. The enemy is coming. Only one leader will rise.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the brink of destruction, power is everything. <i>NWO: Anarchy Collapsed</i> is a <strong>grand strategy game fused with idle mechanics</strong>, where <strong>every second counts</strong>. Your <strong>income grows continuously</strong>, and with smart upgrades, your power expands. Whether by <strong>force or influence</strong>, you must <strong>seize control, unite nations, and prepare for the greatest battle in human history</strong> before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Wishlist Now</strong> and get ready to claim your empire! \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/677fb87b291aac796d3bb606a6aa5318.poster.avif?t=1751527902\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/677fb87b291aac796d3bb606a6aa5318.webm?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/677fb87b291aac796d3bb606a6aa5318.mp4?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Global Conquest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission is clear\u2014<strong>take over and unite all 195 countries</strong> before the enemy arrives. Expand your reach, <strong>capture key territories</strong>, and use <strong>war or diplomacy</strong> to dominate the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/acc8c395882468ad37c98e4dc3863c3f.poster.avif?t=1751527902\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/acc8c395882468ad37c98e4dc3863c3f.webm?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/acc8c395882468ad37c98e4dc3863c3f.mp4?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Income Per Second \u2013 Build &amp; Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money fuels power. <strong>Your income grows every second</strong>\u2014upgrade <strong>factories, businesses, and trade routes</strong> to <strong>increase your wealth and expand your reach</strong>. The <strong>more countries you control, the more resources you command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/a3624a6ec4162a29a58ffe6400c9ae73.poster.avif?t=1751527902\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275610/extras/a3624a6ec4162a29a58ffe6400c9ae73.webm?t=1751527902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st